Customers\n\nAutomatically opens the counter and seats customers at available tables.\n\nYou can set a minimum customer rarity to skip lower-tier customers. The default is None, which accepts everyone.\n\nThe system checks for an available table before assigning a customer.\n\nIf assignments happen too quickly, turn on the delay to give the server time to update.\n\n---\n\n🍔 Auto Deliver Orders\n\nAutomatically picks up finished dishes from the kitchen and delivers them to customers.\n\nAfter delivering, it returns to the counter.\n\nWorks across multiple floors automatically.\n\nYou can adjust the delivery speed with the Serve Delay setting.\n\n---\n\n🧽 Auto Wash Dishes\n\nAutomatically washes dishes when the sink is full.\n\nIt won't interrupt food deliveries and will wait until you're finished serving.\n\n---\n\n🛒 Auto Buy Ingredients\n\nAutomatically goes to the Grocery Store and restocks your ingredients when supplies get low.\n\nSet the percentage at which you want it to restock.\n\nIt buys all available ingredient types at once.\n\nYou need at least 100 pesos for a restock.\n\nKeep this OFF while farming or it may keep teleporting you away.\n\n---\n\n🧹 Auto Clean\n\nAutomatically cleans trash from your restaurant and the main trash area.\n\nRuns in the background, so you don't have to keep checking it.\n\n---\n\n🪑 FURNITURE SHOP\n\nHow It Works\n\nChoose the furniture categories you want, then press Refresh to see what's currently in stock.\n\nYou can select multiple categories at once.\n\nAuto-Watch & Buy\n\n1. Press Refresh to load the current stock.\n2. Select the items you want to watch.\n3. Turn on Auto-Watch & Buy.\n4. Choose how often it checks the shop.\n5. When an item comes back in stock, it buys it automatically.\n\nFor rare or expensive items, use Buy Selected Items (Once) instead to avoid buying multiple copies.\n\n---\n\n🏃 PLAYER UTILITIES\n\nWalk Speed\n\nIncrease your movement speed from the normal speed up to 150 studs/sec.\n\nHigher speeds can look suspicious, so use them carefully.\n\nNoClip\n\nWalk through walls and other objects.\n\nHumanoid Walk looks more natural than teleporting around.\n\nTeleports\n\nQuickly move to useful locations like:\n\n* Counter\n* Kitchen\n* Sink\n* Drink Chiller\n* Mystery Box\n* Merchant\n* Trash Spawner\n\nAnti-AFK\n\nPrevents you from being kicked for being inactive.\n\nServer Hop\n\nFinds less crowded servers when you want a quieter server.\n\nTrash ESP\n\nHighlights trash locations so you can easily find and collect them.\n\n---\n\n⚠️ IMPORTANT TIPS\n\n* Don't leave automation running overnight. Bugs can cause unwanted loops or purchases.\n* Keep an eye on your cash when using Auto Buy Ingredients.\n* If Auto Assign seems stuck, check your customer rarity filter.\n* Humanoid Walk looks more natural than Teleport movement.\n* NoClip can interfere with food deliveries. Turn it off while serving if deliveries stop working.\n* Be careful with Auto-Watch & Buy. It can purchase an item again every time the shop restocks.\n* Use Buy Once for rare or expensive furniture when you only want one.","tags":["autofarm","autobuy","auto serve","abirvoid","Karinderya"],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://gist.githubusercontent.com/abirvoid/ff1619bc0006445030618f15c1bbb1f0/raw/AVOB-Unified-Hub.lua\"))()","owner":{"_id":"6a75f97f78e2cf7f049e8799","username":"abirvoid","verified":false,"profilePicture":"/images/photo/6a75f97f78e2cf7f049e8799-1786116665857.png","status":"offline","id":"6a75f97f78e2cf7f049e8799","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":10000}},"verified":false,"keyless":false,"discord":"https://discord.gg/PTRZ3kC7Zb","keyLink":"https://work.ink/2OMt/AbirVoidKey","views":961,"executes":4889,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":"/images/sb/116497287371701-1791250051657.jpg","likeCount":0,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-09-21T12:30:53.808Z","reviewed":{"name":"QueueSpeedDemon","role":"reviewer","roleLab